  "description": "Icon is a refined and modern woody fragrance that blends aromatic freshness with smoky resinous depth and smooth amber warmth. The scent feels elegant, luxurious, and sophisticated while maintaining a clean versatile character throughout the wear. The opening introduces bergamot, creating a bright citrus freshness that feels crisp, uplifting, and elegant. The heart develops into lavender, incense, and labdanum, adding aromatic smoothness balanced by smoky resinous warmth and rich depth. The base settles into suede, sandalwood, and amber, leaving a creamy woody trail that feels warm, polished, and long-lasting. Icon is perfect for those who enjoy elegant woody fragrances with aromatic freshness and smooth amber-suede depth.",
